WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Welcome to the PrepFord NCLEX-RN pathway, built for Registered Nurse clinical judgment and licensure preparation.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
Sign into your PrepFord account to open the dedicated RN Learner Dashboard.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
Review your RN workspace, Client Needs domain progress, and available practice examinations.

00:26.000 --> 00:36.000
Open RN question practice and launch a scenario-based practice examination.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Examine the RN clinical scenario, client history, bedside vital signs, and priority cues before selecting an answer.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Submit your response to view the keyed intervention and option-by-option clinical rationales.

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
Explore corresponding RN study notes in the 7-domain Nursing Study Guide and review your RN performance insights.

01:12.000 --> 01:25.000
Continue your NCLEX-RN preparation in the PrepFord RN Learner Dashboard.
